-//! The tunnel: TCP to the endpoint's address, through the proxy when one is
-//! set; TLS of [`crate::tls`]; HTTP/2; and one CONNECT, as connect-ip-go's
-//! fork sends it over HTTP/2 (`client_h2.go`, `DialH2`, with usque's
